      "content": "idk i'm just kinda scared to go to the doctor right now bc it's so expensive and it's late and i don't think it's that bad just a little burn. i read online that tea tree oil is really great for skin healing and infections so wouldn't that actually help clean it out? or like, wouldn't the fat in the butter help soothe the heat so it doesn't keep burning my skin? i just really want to handle this at home if i can.",
